{"term":"thorough","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:51c065a523c1dd002a","definition":"Painstaking and careful not to miss or omit any detail.","example":"The Prime Minister announced a thorough investigation into the death of a father-of-two in police custody.","pos":"adj","synonyms":["comprehensive"],"antonyms":["cursory","superficial","surface-level"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["superthorough","thoroughbrace","thoroughbred","thoroughbreed","thoroughfare","thoroughgoing","thoroughlane","thoroughly","thoroughness","thoroughpaced","thoroughsped","thorough-stitch","thoroughwort","unthorough"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/thorough#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:945debf9215a34426f","definition":"Utter; complete; absolute.","example":"Dr. Oldfield once said to me, 'You talk to me quite all right, but why is it that you never open your lips at a committee meeting? You are a drone.' I appreciated the banter. The bees are ever busy, the drone is a thorough idler.","pos":"adj","synonyms":["downright"],"antonyms":["cursory","superficial","surface-level"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["superthorough","thoroughbrace","thoroughbred","thoroughbreed","thoroughfare","thoroughgoing","thoroughlane","thoroughly","thoroughness","thoroughpaced","thoroughsped","thorough-stitch","thoroughwort","unthorough"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/thorough#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:f116233a858fb9cbcb","definition":"Through.","example":"Ye might haue ſeene the frothy billowes fry\n Vnder the ſhip, as thorough them ſhe went […]","pos":"prep","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"archaic","register":"archaic","wordFamily":["superthorough","thoroughbrace","thoroughbred","thoroughbreed","t